        <mxCell id="has_scan" edge="1" parent="1" source="shipment" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=18;strokeWidth=2;startSize=14;endSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=default;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startFill=0;endFill=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.85;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.3;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="scan_event" value="◇ HasScan (identifying)">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="0.46" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="24" y="-18" as="offset" />
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="970" y="430" />
              <mxPoint x="970" y="530" />
              <mxPoint x="1165" y="530" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="occurs_at" edge="1" parent="1" source="scan_event" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=18;strokeWidth=2;startSize=14;endSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=default;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;startArrow=ERzeroToMany;endArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=0;endFill=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="hub" value="OccursAt">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="-55" as="offset" />
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="1540" y="675" />
              <mxPoint x="1540" y="137.5" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="business_rules" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=18;" value="&lt;b&gt;BUSINESS RULES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• HUB.region ∈ {Northeast, Southeast, Midwest, Southwest, West}.&lt;br&gt;• The LANE key is (origin_hub_id, destination_hub_id). The hubs must differ.&lt;br&gt;• HUB and LANE are preloaded reference data. Shipments and departures must use an existing valid directed lane.&lt;br&gt;• SHIPMENT.weight_kg &amp;gt; 0 and DEPARTURE.max_total_weight_kg &amp;gt; 0.&lt;br&gt;• BookedOnto assumes at most one departure per shipment. Each departure may carry many shipments.&lt;br&gt;• The booking procedure atomically checks matching lanes and available capacity using the sum of booked shipment weights.&lt;br&gt;• SCAN_EVENT is a weak entity identified through SHIPMENT; its key is (shipment_id, scan_sequence).&lt;br&gt;• SCAN_EVENT.status and SHIPMENT.current_status use {RECEIVED, IN_TRANSIT, ARRIVED_AT_HUB, OUT_FOR_DELIVERY, DELIVERED}.&lt;br&gt;• The scan chronology trigger enforces valid transitions and nondecreasing timestamps. Intermediate-hub movement may alternate between IN_TRANSIT and ARRIVED_AT_HUB.&lt;br&gt;• SHIPMENT.delivery_outcome ∈ {ON_TIME, LATE, NULL}; it remains NULL until delivery.&lt;br&gt;• Scan insertion triggers maintain current_status and determine delivery_outcome from the promised delivery date." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="420" width="770" x="40" y="1250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="vehicle_specialization_note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=16;" value="Vehicle specialization: partial and disjoint. A vehicle may belong to at most one modeled subtype; other vehicle types are permitted." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="45" width="420" x="395" y="1178" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="scan_event_weak_note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=16;connectable=0;" value="Weak entity" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="350" x="1060" y="755" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
